# Typed binding in a case arm used as a function body.
# Exercises typecheck_case_arm: x gets type scrutinee_ty ∩ Int.
# With scrutinee 5 (Int), x : Int, and [+ x 1] evaluates to 6.
[f: [fn [let n] [match n
  [case [let x@Int] [+ x 1]]
  [case [let _] 0]]]
 result: [f 5]]
=== out
Dict({"f": Function(n), "result": Int(6)})
